PREAMBLE

Alisios Corporation develops CPT-DM as a contribution to the global climate
services community. This software is made freely available for non-commercial
research, education, and public-sector use in support of climate adaptation
and resilience. Alisios Corporation does not seek to profit from this work;
our purpose is to support society in managing climate risks.

